      "message": "I have changed GPIO_ODR_HIGH to GPIO_OPEN_DARIN as compile error is seen,\n\ndevicetree_generated.h:18552:54: error: unsigned conversion from \u0027int\u0027 to \u0027short unsigned int\u0027 changes value from \u0027655367\u0027 to \u00277\u0027 [-Werror\u003doverflow]\n18552 | #define DT_N_S_pwr_sys_rst_l_P_gpios_IDX_0_VAL_flags 655367\n\nchanged as: gpios \u003d \u003c\u0026ioex_it8801_port1 0 (GPIO_OPEN_DARIN|GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW)\u003e;\n\n\"sysrst 1\" functionality works fine but in \"powerindebug\" the PWR_SYS_RST do not reflect the actual value, always set to 1.",
