      "writtenOn": "2026-03-18T15:39:00Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "Can you clarify - is the expectation that `powerindebug` should normally show PWR_SYS_RST with a value of 0 because the signal is active low.\n\nThe EC only asserts (logical state 1, physical state 0) PWR_SYS_RST for 16ms [here](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/subsys/ap_pwrseq/x86_non_dsx_common_pwrseq_sm_handler.c;l\u003d312;drc\u003d4ec6cb1e1bb5744e8c68d6e75e392d4da8e7c03e)",
      "parentUuid": "ddf6e2d2_df9e88d8",
      "range": {
